__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
tests/
.env*
/AGENTS.md
# Host dev virtualenvs: their bin/ symlinks point at host paths that do not
# exist in the image, so a copied venv bakes in a broken interpreter. The
# glob form matters — a bare `.venv` only matches at the context root, which
# let every .claude/worktrees/*/.venv through (148MB of build context).
.venv
**/.venv
